    "https://www.apsu.edu/fac-staff/index.php": {
      "title": "Faculty/Staff Information",
      "description": "Faculty/Staff Information Toggle Menu Toggle Search Go back Alumni Current Students Faculty & Staff Military Parents & Families Close Search Submit Close Search A-Z Index People Search Apply Request Info Visit Give Calendar About APSU Admissions Academics Campus Life Athletics I Am... Alumni Current Student Faculty/Staff Military Parent/Family Apply Request Info Visit Give Calendar Faculty/Staff Information Our goal at Austin Peay is to help you make the most of your time as an employee,\n               regardless of your role. We also want to help you enjoy the many on-campus activities\n               in which you can take part. We invite you to use these resources to achieve your professional\n               goals and make your life as a \"Gov\" memorable. Home » Faculty/Staff Information In this section Faculty/Staff Information Faculty Profiles Do you want to be featured on the Faculty/Staff Directory? Click the link below to\n                     submit your profile information. Submit your profile information Further your education Want to further your education while employed by APSU? Click the link below  and get\n                        that degree you’ve always wanted! Learn more about your benefits here Campus Life APSU Athletics Boyd Health Services Bookstore Center of Excellence for the Creative Arts Dining Services Event Calendars Public Safety/Campus Police Student Affairs University Recreation Academic/Professional Academic Affairs Academic Calendar LIbrary (Felix G. Woodward Library) Office of Student Access Services Online Education Dean's Council Faculty Senate Faculty/Staff Directory Information Technology Professional Headshots Faculty/Staff Profile pages Graduate Studies Human Resources Online Programs Registrar's Office Retirees Association Staff Senate Standing Committees Contact Us Austin Peay State University 601 College Street Clarksville, TN 37044 1-877-861-APSU (931)221-7011 gov@apsu.edu Austin Peay State University 601 College Street Clarksville, TN 37044 (931) 221-7011 Clarksville Campus Austin Peay Center at Fort Campbell Felix G. Woodward Library Home OneStop Pathway Careers at APSU Non-Discrimination Policy Title IX ADA Emergency Management Accreditation Privacy Contact Us Copyright © 2026 Facebook Youtube Twitter Instagram ©"
